            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I believe this bug would be fixed by changing the eval_current_item function in [starter.lua:836](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f2ccb9339c979968b19db48b5f8b31c6f0ee7481/lua/mini/starter.lua#L836)\r\n```lua\r\nfunction MiniStarter.eval_current_item()\r\n  H.eval_fun_or_string(H.items[H.current_item_id].action, true)\r\nend\r\n```\r\nto first clearing the query:\r\n```lua\r\nfunction MiniStarter.eval_current_item()\r\n  H.query = ''\r\n  H.eval_fun_or_string(H.items[H.current_item_id].action, true)\r\nend\r\n```\r\n\r\nI could setup a pull-request. Although I am not yet familiar with contributing to open-source projects.",
